<div class="box box-info"><div class="box-header"><h3 class="box-title">Debt &amp; Balance Overview</h3></div><div class="box-body">
<div class="row"><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="info-box"><span class="info-box-icon bg-red"><i class="fa fa-money"></i></span><div class="info-box-content"><span class="info-box-text">{if $is_reseller_view}Owed to ISP{else}My Receivable{/if}</span><span class="info-box-number">{Lang::moneyFormat($debt_summary['outstanding'])}</span><small>Remaining debt</small></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="info-box"><span class="info-box-icon bg-green"><i class="fa fa-check"></i></span><div class="info-box-content"><span class="info-box-text">Recovered from Profit</span><span class="info-box-number">{Lang::moneyFormat($debt_summary['recovered'])}</span><small>Applied from recharges</small></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="info-box"><span class="info-box-icon bg-purple"><i class="fa fa-wallet"></i></span><div class="info-box-content"><span class="info-box-text">Available Balance</span><span class="info-box-number">{if $is_reseller_view}{Lang::moneyFormat($profit_share)}{else}{Lang::moneyFormat($dash_profit_due)}{/if}</span><small>After debt deductions and payments</small></div></div></div></div>
<p class="text-muted">Recharge profit pays the outstanding debt first. The remainder is added to the reseller balance.</p>
<div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-condensed"><thead><tr><th>Date</th>{if !$is_reseller_view}<th>Reseller</th>{/if}<th>Action</th><th>Amount</th><th>Recharge / Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody>{foreach $debt_history as $d}<tr><td>{$d['created_at']|escape}</td>{if !$is_reseller_view}<td>{foreach $resellers as $r}{if $r['id']==$d['reseller_id']}{$r['name']|escape}{/if}{/foreach}</td>{/if}<td>{if $d['entry_type']=='debt'}Debt added{else}Recovered from profit{/if}</td><td>{Lang::moneyFormat(abs($d['amount']))}</td><td>{if $d['recharge_id']}#{$d['recharge_id']} — {/if}{$d['note']|escape}</td></tr>{foreachelse}<tr><td colspan="5">No debt activity yet.</td></tr>{/foreach}</tbody></table></div>
{if !$is_reseller_view}<a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="{Text::url('reseller/settlements')}">Manage Receivable</a>{/if}
</div></div>